  "description": "Mysterious crime cases. Mysterious deaths.   \nLee Ji-Ran, a detective, fails to catch his most wanted criminal. The criminal walks purposely into the road and gets hit by a truck, which leads to his death. After the incident, an agent comes up to Ji-Ran and asks him, if a pied piper was seen on the crime scene. Is this the doing of the so-called \"Pied Piper\"?\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list.nhn?titleId=563787)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English (Expired)](https://comic.naver.com/en/list.html?titleId=563787)",
